{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港金牛簽入NBA前球員麥卡。</p><p></p><p>香港金牛球員麥卡說︰「香港金牛，我是麥卡，急不及待加入球隊，很興奮。」</p><p></p><p>身高2米13的麥卡司職大前鋒，在2016年NBA選秀中以第10順位被公鹿選中，之後效力過活塞及騎士，在NBA累積出戰279場，場均4.7分及2.8個籃板，曾單場取得23分。球隊表示他的加入能鞏固防守。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:20:01.934641+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T10:17:36.283586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:17:36.283586+00:00","content_hash":"fdd1126b96fc4612298343416ed9bffb4f4fd7cc0ac1bd493fecc15aae9e80e2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}